{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年37歲的金像獎最佳女配角陳靜（DaDa）近年大幅減產過著半淡出的寫意生活，周遊列國後仍對香港情有獨鍾。近日她罕有分享乘搭百年雙層「叮叮車」的懷舊短片，身穿黑色掛頸無袖上衣配復古直筒牛仔褲，大騷緊緻肩頸線條，在無人的木質車廂內吹風賞霓虹，散發濃厚的王家衛電影感。短片更緊貼The Weeknd啟德個唱掀起的熱話，選用王菲1993年金曲《季候風》原版作配樂，並感性配文展開「時光之旅」。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳靜罕曬香港街頭懷舊短片。（IG＠dadachan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197572717374083072647321.png/NREpl5teNzJuRRlnZvPqgfnKs0gp86hu1gGE2tYBhNo\"/><figcaption>陳靜罕曬香港街頭懷舊短片。（IG＠dadachan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"復古造型搭電車飄90年代港星韻味。（IG＠dadachan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197572715146776576049317.png/UHnJdQbCWRvN4wONWzMALxAKUvWHi95FRM1JOETNSTg\"/><figcaption>復古造型搭電車飄90年代港星韻味。（IG＠dadachan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"倚木窗框托腮賞霓虹。（IG＠dadachan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197572713024327680182390.png/lxu7rIG-V3Ohomv92Z13OGcFQID8I1RFE1XiSxNV4ks\"/><figcaption>倚木窗框托腮賞霓虹。（IG＠dadachan）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"借王菲金曲致敬黃金歲月。（IG＠dadachan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197572710885101568042165.png/Xj95fsxCM6efpzNNU_a29ePCsUuhbvSgqFiocKhYqHA\"/><figcaption>借王菲金曲致敬黃金歲月。（IG＠dadachan）</figcaption></figure><p>加拿大巨星The Weeknd（威肯）早前在啟德體育園主場館舉行個唱，期間震撼演繹採樣自王菲《季候風》的致敬新作《Hong Kong》，在全港掀起熱潮；陳靜此行亦緊貼話題，以王菲原版作配樂展開時光之旅。</p><figure><img alt=\"選用王菲《季候風》原版致敬經典。（IG＠dadachan）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261112/1197572708569714688783264.png/n4m6TAJ1QQsIBJriV6staPKb2WdWbfb8Oq-9tDqvvbQ\"/><figcaption>選用王菲《季候風》原版致敬經典。（IG＠dadachan）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-12T11:35:48.413516+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":433,"images":5,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-12T11:15:34+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-12T12:17:26.380989+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-12T11:29:20.462345+00:00","content_hash":"6906a1e8f4da182cd2cc383fb773264a96441e001988940204d068b6c78a637a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}